        <mxCell id="37" value="vlink::Co 池化 C++20 协程 (include/vlink/base/coroutine.h)&lt;br&gt;• TaskPromise&amp;lt;T&amp;gt; / DetachedTask 协程帧直走全局 MemoryPool，零堆碎片&lt;br&gt;• FinalAwaiter 对称转移防栈溢出；支持 when_all / when_any / sequence&lt;br&gt;• 队列满时按三态 ResumePostResult 交由 FutureWaitLoop 退避重试，绝不持锁睡眠" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=5;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#1976D2;strokeWidth=1.4;fontColor=#0D47A1;fontSize=8.8;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK SC, Helvetica Neue, Arial, sans-serif;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
